      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-306036",
      ":question/problem": "The table shows the test scores, rounded to the nearest whole number, for a group of $50$ students.\n\n| Score | Number of Students |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $74$ | $5$ |\n| $76$ | $7$ |\n| $78$ | $10$ |\n| $80$ | $12$ |\n| $82$ | $9$ |\n| $84$ | $7$ |\n\nA new score of $100$ is added to the dataset, making $51$ scores in total. Which statement best compares the mean and median of the new dataset to those of the original dataset?\n\nThe mean of the new dataset is {{field-1}} the mean of the original dataset.\n\nThe median of the new dataset is {{field-2}} the median of the original dataset."
